    {"id":"eaae7714-019e-4f9e-96b4-b42aba569134","name":"Sticky Note 80581b1a","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[1168,1088],"parameters":{"content":"## After-Hours Emergency Capture\nA Twilio call-summary event flags after-hours (Mon-Thu 5pm-8am, Fri 2pm-8am, all weekend) missed calls. If the caller matches a Google Contact, an immediate SMS offers URGENT/BOOK/INFO options and an On-Call calendar event alerts the dentist; the pending case is tracked in the \"emergency_calls\" Data Table. A second trigger watches inbound SMS replies and routes by keyword: URGENT emails the on-call dentist and reassures the patient, BOOK fetches a Calendly emergency slot and books it on the Appointments calendar, INFO sends office hours. Adjust the Twilio Insights payload field names in the Code nodes to match your actual Twilio webhook schema once connected.","color":4}}
